  en.title: TLS certificate expires within 14 days — 10.0.0.5:8080
  en.desc: "The certificate is still valid, but expires within 14 days.\n\nExposure rule “tls-certificate-expiring-14d” violated. Condition: TLS {present: true, expired: false, valid for less than 14 days}.\nRemediation: Plan the certificate renewal."
